# Language rules for English: function words, role nouns, negators and
# per-corpus vocabulary belongs in <corpus>.relations, which extends this.
# Grammar: alias|query-relation|evidence-verb, person|term, skip|term,
#          negate|term, norm|from|to, where|term, why|term, how|term,
#          place|term, topic|term, copula|term, article|term,
#          prep|term, own|term, poss|shape, aux|term, agent|term,
#          link|term, genitive|term
# where/why/how are the MARKER words that make a sentence answer that question;
# place seeds the place class the way person seeds the person class.
